 ## Background
-This method was introduced as an efficient algorithm to exploit rasterization hardware for displaying shaded isosurfaces using a 3D gradient map [S1, unofficial]. It was adapted for the GeForce graphics processor using multi-stage rasterization [S1, unofficial]. The original work is attributed to Westermann and Ertl [S2]. It is used in interactive volume rendering on standard PC graphics hardware [S2].
